rss" /><summary type="html">A person intentionally drove into a group of people in a northern German town, police have said. Three people have been taken into custody in what police said was likely a gang confrontation.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>German police probe cruise ship captain after Bremerhaven collision</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f2c6cca847874df58cacb72c898baf8ab0cf8a901104edfad8e677c78ce754e6</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:41:03Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T17:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/german-police-probe-cruise-ship-captain-after-bremerhaven-collision/a-79769346--ffe109304bf6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/german-police-probe-cruise-ship-captain-after-bremerhaven-collision/a-79769346?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">A three-ship collision has led to the cancellation of a cruise and expensive damages. Shipyard repairs are needed, and further cruises could be affected.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Germany news: Audi boss slammed over Trump rally appearance</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e2f2ee0666c465746904639bc5d2066c62eb2aa966712ecde08a5aa96533359c</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:41:03Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T10:00:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/germany-news-audi-boss-slammed-over-trump-rally-appearance/live-79760097--dae75316366b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/germany-news-audi-boss-slammed-over-trump-rally-appearance/live-79760097?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Audi's boss is facing a backlash in Germany after appearing alongside Donald Trump at a campaign rally. Meanwhile, Germany's chancellor and president are heading to Asia on separate diplomatic missions.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>What Germany thinks of carmaker Audi's $4 billion deal with Trump</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f991824ae6e476c3b61d48b8d69f50f5704c452747aa275108fef7d2ad688a93</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:41:03Z</updated><published>2026-10-26T15:16:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/what-germany-thinks-of-carmaker-audi-s-4-billion-deal-with-trump/a-79760479--6c6f86b95e86.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/what-germany-thinks-of-carmaker-audi-s-4-billion-deal-with-trump/a-79760479?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">The luxury carmaker is set to open its first factory in the United States — a move Trump credits to his tariffs. DW examines the German reaction amid a massive auto industry cull at home.</summary><category term="Business" /></entry><entry><title>Harry Kane: Ballon d’Or for Bayern Munich striker</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:b573047688d97b5334856eb5221750e88209c5d60a50d957bba14a83320c1ef0</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:41:03Z</updated><published>2026-10-27T14:11:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/harry-kane-ballon-d-or-for-bayern-munich-striker/a-79723299--2a5c9f9ed870.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/harry-kane-ballon-d-or-for-bayern-munich-striker/a-79723299?maca=en-rss-en-ger-1023-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Bayern Munich striker Harry Kane has won football's most prestigious individual prize, beating Kylian Mbappe and Lamine Yamal. Kane has developed even more in the Bundesliga despite an uneven league.</summary><category term="Sports" /></entry><entry><title>German national facing trial for alleged attempt to join IS</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:f09ec91d864a15180926ba39a5202f8a762175b0a55c722856beaab86b2e9d9f</id><updated>2026-10-27T14:41:03Z</updated><published>2026-10-24T15:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/german-national-facing-trial-for-alleged-attempt-to-join-is/a-79751032--cd661b98dd30.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="ht